Package: wyrm-mail
Version: @VERSION@
Section: mail
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Kleanthis Kyriazakis <kleanthis.kyriaz@hotmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/kkyriazakis/wyrm-mail
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libasound2 | libasound2t64, libatk1.0-0, libcairo2, libdbus-1-3, libffi8, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libgcc-s1, libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0, libglib2.0-0 | libglib2.0-0t64, libgtk-3-0 | libgtk-3-0t64, libpango-1.0-0, libpulse0, libstdc++6, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcb-shm0, libxcb1, libxcomposite1, libxcursor1, libxdamage1, libxext6, libxfixes3, libxi6, libxinerama1, libxrandr2, libxrender1, libxt6, libzstd1, zlib1g, hicolor-icon-theme
Recommends: hunspell-en-us
Suggests: ffmpeg
Description: Outlook-first email client based on Thunderbird
 Wyrm Mail is a native email client for Linux. It connects to Microsoft 365
 and Outlook accounts through Microsoft Graph, alongside Gmail and standard
 IMAP and SMTP accounts.
